    "chunk_text": "Halsung. Ic halsige \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne \u00e6lmihtigan God, \u00fee gesceop heofonas & eor\u00f0an & ealle gesceafta, & \u00feurh \u00fea Eac ic halsige \u00fee eow \u00feurh \u00fea twelf apostolas, \u00fee \u00feam ecean Gode gecorene w\u00e6ron, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t Ic halsige \u00fee eac \u00feurh ealle halignyssa, \u00fee synt on heofonan & on eor\u00f0an, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne fulluht & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu na ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00feises husles onbyrige, buton \u00feu si unscyldig \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feinges, \u00fee \u00feu nu Ic halsige \u00fee eow \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne F\u00e6der & Sunu & \u00fe\u00e6ne halegan Gast & \u00feurh \u00feine eowre cristennysse, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu na ge\u00feristl\u00e6ce natestohwi to \u00feisum husle to ganne ne fur\u00feon to \u00feisum weofude to Ic halsige \u00fee nu, mann, \u00feurh getingnysse ures drihnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne dom & Ic halsige \u00fee \u00feurh F\u00e6der & Sunu & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6ne halegan Gast & \u00fea halegan \u00ferynnysse, \u00fea & \u00feurh \u00fea feower godspelleras Matheus, Marcus, Lucas, Iohannes & \u00feurh \u00fea twelf witigan & Ic halsige \u00fee \u00feurh \u00fea \u00fery cnihtas, \u00fee d\u00e6ghwamlice beforan Gode standa\u00f0, Sidrac, Misac et gyf \u00feu scyldig si , \u00fe\u00e6nne ahnexa \u00feu \u00feine heortan & geandet, swa hw\u00e6tt swa \u00feu \u00fear onwite. We bidda\u00f0 \u00fee, drihten h\u00e6lend Crist, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu sette her on \u00fein tacn swa: gif \u00fees mann scild",
